id: as-08-two-fires
number: 408
name: Two Fires
pool: Hard
description: Two separate fights on one board, ten tiles apart. A faces things that hurt; B faces a Grappler and a Stalker that cannot deal a point of damage between them.
design: Asymmetry 8 — split deployment where converging is the trap.
design: The board is eleven wide and the two players start ten tiles apart, with a high ridge down the middle between them. West is a damage fight; east is a displacement fight with no damage in it at all.

spawn h = Husk
spawn l = Lobber
spawn g = Grappler
spawn s = Stalker

roster a: Vanguard, Archer
roster b: Threadcaster, Wardbearer

